      "text": "Hello, my name is Claude Piannis, I'm from IBM Research Brazil in the University of São Paulo. And I'm going to talk to you about the inyengato digital project, which is a collaboration between the University of São Paulo, IBM Research, the Federation of Organizations Indigenous of Hyundai Group, and of the work of a very extensive team that you can see in this slide. The context of this project is what's happening in the Amazon today. Fast internet is arriving in the Amazon through devices like Starlink. And this influx of new information at a much faster speed than before is really threatening the language and the cultures of Indigenous peoples there. And we have to understand that those peoples play an essential",
